rnnoise (vendored)
==================

Upstream:  https://github.com/xiph/rnnoise
Version:   v0.2 release tarball (rnnoise-0.2.tar.gz from the GitHub release)
License:   BSD-3-Clause (see LICENSE)

The release tarball is used rather than a git checkout because it includes the
generated model weights (source/rnnoise_data.c, ~5 MB); git checkouts fetch
them separately with download_model.sh.

What was taken
--------------
include/rnnoise.h, the 10 library .c files listed in CMakeLists.txt, their
headers, and src/x86/x86_arch_macros.h (always included by vec.h). Left out:
autotools files, examples, training tools (dump_features.c, write_weights.c),
and the optional x86 runtime CPU dispatch (src/x86/*.c, RNN_ENABLE_X86_RTCD).

Local changes
-------------
- source/os_support.h: added. vec.h (generic path) and vec_neon.h include it,
  but the 0.2 tarball doesn't ship it, which breaks non-x86 builds. It only
  provides OPUS_CLEAR.
- CMakeLists.txt: ours (upstream uses autotools).

Upgrading
---------
Download the new release tarball, copy over the same file set, and diff.
Check whether os_support.h is still missing upstream.
